  "abstract": "Confirm minimal per-horizon calibration on higher-capacity ScalarRamp baseline (H=160). Same 32-param bias head scaled by 0.02 with L2 and zero-mean penalties. MAE+curvature (\u03bb=1e\u22124), Adam lr=9e\u22124, clip=1.0, drop=0.05, p=36, learn_gamma=False.",
